# boot-tree-demands.tbl -- what a measurement of an sh container demands of
# the stage's boot tree at generation time: '<measurement> <path under boot/>
# <grep pattern or -> <remedy...>'. Read by 'stage measurement requirements'
# (stage earlboot|elvbootd mk refuse while a demand is missing, stage require
# reports). measure_bootlock (kldstat -m mac_bootlock at boot) is only true
# when the loader preloaded the module from the manifest-covered tree.
measure_bootlock loader.conf ^mac_bootlock_load="YES" stage edit <stage> loader.conf
measure_bootlock kernel/mac_bootlock.ko - stage build kernel, stage install kernel, stage filter add <stage> kernel/mac_bootlock.ko, stage include
